WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.370
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:36.640 --> 00:38.159
I won't take it to heart.

3
00:38.679 --> 00:39.600
When it comes to my own life,

4
00:39.600 --> 00:40.479
I know what I'm doing.

5
00:40.920 --> 00:41.880
Don't take it to heart either.

6
01:17.040 --> 01:18.879
What kind of caps are these? They're all ruined.

7
01:23.959 --> 01:24.480
Director Cheng.

8
01:25.159 --> 01:26.159
What's up with you?

9
01:26.680 --> 01:27.840
Plant's been shut down for two days,

10
01:28.120 --> 01:29.040
and you've gotten rusty too?

11
01:36.799 --> 01:37.359
Shunzi.

12
01:38.319 --> 01:39.640
Two days without work,

13
01:40.239 --> 01:42.040
and Workshop Two hasn't raised hell?

14
01:43.280 --> 01:44.120
Of course we have.

15
01:44.359 --> 01:45.400
Everyone's downed tools.

16
01:49.400 --> 01:49.840
Director Cheng,

17
01:50.640 --> 01:52.319
I heard Ma Guowen's out to settle scores,

18
01:53.040 --> 01:54.280
especially with your bottling workshop.

19
01:54.719 --> 01:55.560
You'd better watch your back.

20
01:57.000 --> 01:58.200
Someone definitely snitched.

21
01:58.879 --> 02:00.799
We've got a traitor among us.

22
02:02.840 --> 02:03.480
I'm off.

23
03:57.840 --> 03:59.039
This scarf is pretty nice.

24
03:59.039 --> 04:00.280
It's thick and warm.

25
04:00.800 --> 04:02.400
It'll last you eight to ten years.

26
04:03.120 --> 04:04.280
How much do you even make, anyway?

27
04:04.280 --> 04:05.759
Why spend so much money on this?

28
04:06.280 --> 04:08.039
Just tell me if I've got good taste.

29
04:08.319 --> 04:09.560
You're just buttering me up.

30
04:09.560 --> 04:10.759
Just tell me, do you like it or not?

31
04:11.080 --> 04:11.639
All right, I like it.

32
04:13.400 --> 04:13.840
Who is it?

33
04:15.080 --> 04:16.839
How come you still have my mom's key?

34
04:16.839 --> 04:17.920
Haipeng?

35
04:18.160 --> 04:20.240
Why'd you buy so much stuff again?

36
04:20.800 --> 04:21.279
I'm telling you,

37
04:21.279 --> 04:23.040
the fridge is already packed full.

38
04:23.040 --> 04:24.319
There's no room left.

39
04:24.480 --> 04:25.319
I was just thinking...

40
04:25.319 --> 04:26.920
It got freezing cold outside,

41
04:27.160 --> 04:28.160
so try not to go out unless you have to.

42
04:28.160 --> 04:28.480
Okay.

43
04:29.519 --> 04:30.319
If you really must go out,

44
04:30.519 --> 04:31.600
remember to bundle up in your thick coat.

45
04:33.240 --> 04:33.680
What's this?

46
04:33.680 --> 04:34.800
The fridge is full,

47
04:35.680 --> 04:36.720
so I'll put it out on the balcony.

48
04:36.720 --> 04:37.199
All right.

49
04:39.480 --> 04:40.120
Haipeng.

50
04:40.319 --> 04:42.040
I want some apples and red dates.

51
04:42.040 --> 04:42.519
Sure.

52
04:44.759 --> 04:45.680
What are you just standing there for?

53
04:45.680 --> 04:47.319
Put that stuff out on the balcony for me.

54
04:47.959 --> 04:48.920
Let me do it. Let me do it.

55
04:49.000 --> 04:49.879
You really are something.

56
04:50.240 --> 04:51.120
Give it to me. Give it to me.

57
04:52.079 --> 04:53.000
I'll buy some for you later.

58
04:53.040 --> 04:53.480
Okay.

59
04:54.240 --> 04:54.639
Give it to me.

60
04:54.639 --> 04:55.160
I've got it.

61
04:57.319 --> 04:59.240
Liu Xuemei used to travel to Qingzhou often back then.

62
05:00.639 --> 05:02.319
Do you recall if she ever

63
05:02.319 --> 05:05.000
mentioned a Qingzhou cab driver?

64
05:07.639 --> 05:08.639
I don't think so.

65
05:10.279 --> 05:10.680
Besides,

66
05:10.680 --> 05:12.720
that was a decade ago. How would I remember?

67
05:15.839 --> 05:16.800
What are you up to now?

68
05:17.639 --> 05:18.560
Nothing.

69
05:21.800 --> 05:22.600
Let me tell you,

70
05:23.279 --> 05:24.120
a few days ago,

71
05:24.759 --> 05:26.079
Old Qian almost died.

72
05:26.560 --> 05:27.800
Can't you just leave things alone?

73
05:31.000 --> 05:31.759
Just get out of here.

74
05:33.319 --> 05:33.720
I'm leaving.

75
05:33.720 --> 05:34.360
I've got things to do.

76
05:35.480 --> 05:36.160
I'm heading out now.

77
05:36.399 --> 05:37.000
Haipeng,

78
05:37.319 --> 05:39.959
I was thinking we still need a freezer. What should we do?

79
05:41.240 --> 05:42.079
Once the weather warms up,

80
05:42.079 --> 05:42.800
I'll get one for you.

81
05:43.000 --> 05:43.560
Good, good, good.

82
05:43.680 --> 05:45.160
Bundle up warm when you go outside!

83
05:45.519 --> 05:45.839
I'm off.

84
05:45.920 --> 05:46.639
Take care!

85
05:47.319 --> 05:48.040
Xiaoqin.

86
05:48.800 --> 05:50.199
Is your dad free today?

87
05:50.399 --> 05:51.399
I'd like to take him out for a meal.

88
05:52.439 --> 05:53.639
It's nothing.

89
05:54.120 --> 05:56.319
Wasn't he director of the Commerce Bureau back then,

90
05:56.600 --> 05:58.680
overseeing the brewery auction and all?

91
05:59.639 --> 06:00.519
I wanted to ask him a few questions.

92
06:02.240 --> 06:03.720
All right, I'll wait to hear from you.

93
06:23.079 --> 06:23.480
Chuang.

94
06:24.439 --> 06:25.639
This is Chen Qingchun's car.

95
06:36.079 --> 06:36.360
Let's go.

96
06:41.240 --> 06:41.800
Old Chen,

97
06:42.399 --> 06:43.720
what's wrong with you these days?

98
06:44.199 --> 06:45.120
You look completely out of it.

99
06:46.000 --> 06:48.319
I crashed into that sculpture outside the brewery.

100
06:49.160 --> 06:50.040
Now they want me to pay for it.

101
06:50.519 --> 06:52.120
It already cost me a fortune to fix my car!

102
06:52.839 --> 06:53.560
Later on,

103
06:53.639 --> 06:54.680
let's go grab a drink.

104
06:55.319 --> 06:56.240
Shake off this bad luck.

105
06:57.600 --> 06:58.480
Not today.

106
06:58.480 --> 06:59.120
I'm not in the mood.

107
06:59.360 --> 07:00.600
Liquor's the essence of grain!

108
07:00.720 --> 07:02.000
The more you drink, the younger you stay!

109
07:02.720 --> 07:03.279
Come on, let's go.

110
07:03.279 --> 07:03.879
Come with us.

111
07:05.279 --> 07:06.920
My in-laws are coming over today.

112
07:08.040 --> 07:09.040
I've gotta get home early.

113
07:09.319 --> 07:11.079
Then invite the former director along too!

114
07:11.319 --> 07:12.240
He's already retired.

115
07:12.240 --> 07:13.240
What's the point?

116
07:13.240 --> 07:13.759
Some other day.

117
07:14.160 --> 07:14.800
Come on.

118
07:15.120 --> 07:15.639
Let's go, come on.

119
07:15.680 --> 07:16.560
Who's Chen Qingchun?

120
07:25.040 --> 07:25.959
Three plates of mutton,

121
07:26.160 --> 07:28.040
frozen tofu, glass noodles,

122
07:29.120 --> 07:30.120
and black fungus.

123
07:31.959 --> 07:32.680
Xiaoqin,

124
07:32.879 --> 07:34.360
between pickled cabbage and spinach,

125
07:34.360 --> 07:35.399
which one do you prefer?

126
07:36.279 --> 07:37.480
Let's see what Leshui likes.

127
07:37.480 --> 07:38.480
I'm good with anything, Uncle.

128
07:38.800 --> 07:40.319
Then pickled cabbage and spinach,

129
07:40.319 --> 07:41.000
one order of each.

130
07:42.199 --> 07:43.639
Two plates of dumplings, too:

131
07:43.800 --> 07:44.600
one pickled cabbage,

132
07:44.600 --> 07:45.360
and one three-delicacy.

133
07:45.800 --> 07:46.199
What about you two?

134
07:46.199 --> 07:48.000
Want some sesame flatbread as well?

135
07:48.480 --> 07:49.600
That's enough, Dad.

136
07:50.000 --> 07:50.439
All right.

137
07:50.480 --> 07:51.519
That should be plenty.

138
07:52.319 --> 07:53.079
All right, just a moment.

139
07:53.160 --> 07:53.639
Uncle...

140
07:54.000 --> 07:54.439
Wait.

141
07:54.800 --> 07:55.240
Say...

142
07:55.240 --> 07:57.000
you prepare dumpling dipping sauce, right?

143
07:57.480 --> 07:57.920
Yes, we do.

144
07:58.160 --> 07:58.959
Three dashes of vinegar,

145
07:59.120 --> 08:00.079
two dashes of soy sauce,

146
08:00.439 --> 08:01.439
a spoonful of chili oil,

147
08:01.680 --> 08:02.560
and a spoonful of minced garlic.

148
08:02.800 --> 08:03.480
Sure thing, just a moment.

149
08:03.480 --> 08:04.000
Make it quick!

150
08:06.759 --> 08:07.759
Shen Leshui.

151
08:08.800 --> 08:09.480
Hello, Director Zheng.

152
08:10.399 --> 08:11.639
Drop the "Director."

153
08:11.959 --> 08:12.759
I'm retired.

154
08:14.879 --> 08:15.319
As for me,

155
08:15.319 --> 08:17.600
I really don't like people calling me "Director."

156
08:18.439 --> 08:20.279
Makes me feel out of touch with the people.

157
08:21.160 --> 08:23.240
You can just call me Old Zheng.

158
08:23.560 --> 08:24.680
Or Uncle, either is fine.

159
08:25.240 --> 08:26.360
Xiaoqin knows that about me.

160
08:26.720 --> 08:27.160
A guy like me,

161
08:27.160 --> 08:28.079
I don't care for formalities.

162
08:28.839 --> 08:30.040
I like joking around.

163
08:31.519 --> 08:32.519
I'm easygoing.

164
08:34.159 --> 08:35.159
Dad, let's eat first.

165
08:35.840 --> 08:36.919
Let me propose a toast.

166
08:37.720 --> 08:38.600
Leshui.

167
08:38.879 --> 08:40.480
"The wise find joy in water."

168
08:40.799 --> 08:41.960
What a great name.

169
08:42.440 --> 08:43.240
Thank you, Uncle.

170
08:43.679 --> 08:46.080
I've always respected cultured,

171
08:46.080 --> 08:46.960
educated folks.

172
08:47.600 --> 08:49.639
Comrade Shen Leshui is someone special now.

173
08:49.879 --> 08:52.840
A renowned journalist!

174
08:53.639 --> 08:54.279
And today,

175
08:54.279 --> 08:56.759
to have lunch with Comrade Shen Leshui,

176
08:56.879 --> 08:58.759
is truly a great joy of mine.

177
08:59.519 --> 09:00.000
Come on, Dad.

178
09:00.240 --> 09:00.600
Make your toast.

179
09:00.840 --> 09:01.559
Right, right, right.

180
09:02.120 --> 09:03.879
Just two more words and I'm done.

181
09:03.960 --> 09:05.240
What you eat doesn't matter.

182
09:05.759 --> 09:07.679
It's who you eat with that counts.

183
09:08.440 --> 09:09.279
All my life,

184
09:09.600 --> 09:10.759
I've lived by one principle:

185
09:11.360 --> 09:12.440
It's good to make friends,

186
09:12.720 --> 09:13.759
enjoy making friends,

187
09:14.039 --> 09:15.440
and make good friends.

188
09:16.639 --> 09:17.120
Come on, Dad.

189
09:17.240 --> 09:17.759
Cheers.

190
09:18.600 --> 09:20.320
That's so profound, Uncle.

191
09:20.440 --> 09:21.000
Oh, not at all.

192
09:21.120 --> 09:22.000
I'm rambling.

193
09:23.840 --> 09:24.840
Say...

194
09:25.679 --> 09:26.960
The night of Cao Jun's accident,

195
09:26.960 --> 09:27.639
what were you doing?

196
09:29.759 --> 09:31.320
Cao Jun?

197
09:33.759 --> 09:35.559
Didn't you know about that night?

198
09:36.159 --> 09:36.879
I...

199
09:37.480 --> 09:38.320
I was driving,

200
09:38.320 --> 09:41.080
and that sculpture outside the factory gate...

201
09:41.399 --> 09:41.960
I crashed right into it.

202
09:42.120 --> 09:42.960
Past two in the morning.

203
09:44.440 --> 09:45.240
Points deducted,

204
09:45.679 --> 09:46.440
got fined,

205
09:47.159 --> 09:48.080
and they want compensation.

206
09:48.759 --> 09:49.639
I was really...

207
09:50.360 --> 09:51.000
totally out of it.

208
09:51.000 --> 09:51.840
My eyesight's bad.

209
09:52.240 --> 09:54.080
What were you doing going back there so late?

210
09:54.360 --> 09:55.000
No, no, no.

211
09:55.159 --> 09:55.679
I wasn't going to the factory.

212
09:55.679 --> 09:56.720
I... I...

213
09:57.519 --> 09:58.000
was going home.

214
09:58.600 --> 09:59.159
Passed by there.

215
09:59.480 --> 10:01.559
Once I got there, I got a bit dazed.

216
10:01.840 --> 10:04.559
I completely lost my sense of direction.

217
10:05.240 --> 10:05.960
Heading home from where?

218
10:08.639 --> 10:09.279
I... I...

219
10:09.279 --> 10:12.039
I had a few drinks at my son's place.

220
10:12.759 --> 10:13.600
Afterwards,

221
10:13.600 --> 10:14.399
I took a nap.

222
10:15.360 --> 10:16.799
Woke up around one o'clock.

223
10:17.879 --> 10:19.639
Thought I'd be fine.

224
10:20.039 --> 10:21.240
Thought I could drive.

225
10:21.799 --> 10:22.360
Besides,

226
10:22.360 --> 10:24.720
hardly anyone's on the road that late.

227
10:25.480 --> 10:27.240
So I drove home.

228
10:28.039 --> 10:29.480
But when I got near that spot,

229
10:30.159 --> 10:32.399
I started feeling dizzy and confused again.

230
10:33.279 --> 10:33.919
Anyway,

231
10:34.559 --> 10:35.639
just like that... bam!

232
10:35.960 --> 10:37.080
You can't drink and drive.

233
10:37.480 --> 10:38.240
Right, right.

234
10:38.519 --> 10:39.639
The traffic police already handled it.

235
10:42.240 --> 10:42.879
Uncle,

236
10:43.720 --> 10:45.159
do you still remember

237
10:45.399 --> 10:46.759
back during the '99 restructuring,

238
10:46.759 --> 10:47.600
the factory auctions?

239
10:48.080 --> 10:49.840
You were in charge of many such projects.

240
10:56.720 --> 10:57.639
That was all

241
10:58.879 --> 11:00.120
years ago.

242
11:01.600 --> 11:02.480
Why do you ask?

243
11:03.600 --> 11:04.799
We're making a promo video.

244
11:05.960 --> 11:06.559
Right, right, right.

245
11:07.720 --> 11:09.720
The documentary on Lapi Brewery back then—

246
11:09.720 --> 11:10.720
you shot that, right?

247
11:11.440 --> 11:11.879
Yes.

248
11:12.159 --> 11:12.799
"Malt Kingdom."

249
11:13.639 --> 11:14.279
Right, right, right.

250
11:14.360 --> 11:15.360
I remember now.

251
11:15.799 --> 11:16.879
Xiaoqin showed it to me.

252
11:17.159 --> 11:17.879
You did a great job.

253
11:18.440 --> 11:19.240
Thank you, Uncle.

254
11:20.759 --> 11:21.600
Uncle,

255
11:22.279 --> 11:24.799
were you close with Director Ma?

256
11:27.720 --> 11:29.759
Xiaoqin loves spinach.

257
11:31.279 --> 11:31.799
Dad.

258
11:33.080 --> 11:34.039
Leshui's asking you.

259
11:34.360 --> 11:35.639
Were you close with Director Ma?

260
11:38.519 --> 11:39.320
Back then,

261
11:39.320 --> 11:40.559
we had some work dealings.

262
11:41.159 --> 11:42.919
A lot of people dealt with me back then.

263
11:44.720 --> 11:45.759
Eat up, help yourself.

264
11:55.320 --> 11:55.919
Sir,

265
11:56.480 --> 11:58.720
do you remember Liu Xuemei?

266
11:59.519 --> 12:01.279
She was a beer taster at Lapi Brewery.

267
12:01.759 --> 12:04.679
Died on the street in the winter of 2000.

268
12:09.799 --> 12:10.600
I remember now.

269
12:10.960 --> 12:11.639
Back then,

270
12:11.639 --> 12:12.519
it was in the news.

271
12:13.240 --> 12:15.320
Heard she'd had too much to drink.

272
12:16.039 --> 12:16.720
Around here,

273
12:16.720 --> 12:18.000
every winter, people getting drunk

274
12:18.000 --> 12:20.360
and freezing to death by the road is common.

275
12:21.399 --> 12:21.960
So you see,

276
12:22.240 --> 12:23.960
you should never overdrink.

277
12:28.200 --> 12:29.960
Did you see Cao Jun before he died?

278
12:31.559 --> 12:32.279
Cao Jun?

279
12:33.919 --> 12:34.840
Never mind before he died,

280
12:36.039 --> 12:36.759
well,

281
12:36.840 --> 12:38.320
I hadn't seen him in years.

282
12:38.840 --> 12:40.559
He was just a forklift driver,

283
12:40.679 --> 12:42.120
and he left the plant later on.

284
12:42.840 --> 12:45.159
I was the brewery's chief engineer.

285
12:46.240 --> 12:47.639
We never really had occasion to talk.

286
12:48.480 --> 12:50.960
Where did chief engineer rank at the brewery?

287
12:53.159 --> 12:54.480
Can't really put a rank on it,

288
12:55.240 --> 12:55.799
but, you know,

289
12:55.799 --> 12:56.919
when it came to the technical side,

290
12:59.000 --> 12:59.799
I was still the one...

291
12:59.799 --> 13:00.720
I called the shots.

292
13:05.480 --> 13:06.480
As far as you recall,

293
13:06.480 --> 13:09.480
did anyone have trouble with Qian Yichuan,

294
13:09.759 --> 13:10.519
Cao Jun,

295
13:10.519 --> 13:11.080
or Ma Guowen?

296
13:11.159 --> 13:11.879
Any clashes with them?

297
13:14.720 --> 13:16.279
Qian Yichuan?

298
13:17.080 --> 13:18.799
He was a gatekeeper at the old plant.

299
13:19.399 --> 13:20.919
Between him and me,

300
13:21.600 --> 13:22.679
there was quite a distance.

301
13:23.519 --> 13:24.240
And I...

302
13:24.720 --> 13:25.799
I didn't really know him well.

303
13:26.600 --> 13:27.399
So I shouldn't speak out of turn.

304
13:28.039 --> 13:30.240
Now, Ma Guowen,

305
13:31.120 --> 13:32.080
he had a bad temper.

306
13:32.679 --> 13:34.399
I actually butted heads with him a few times.

307
13:35.440 --> 13:37.720
But that was all a long time ago.

308
13:38.799 --> 13:39.519
Anyway,

309
13:39.840 --> 13:41.240
a man like me,

310
13:41.919 --> 13:43.039
I've always believed in

311
13:43.840 --> 13:45.039
staying humble,

312
13:45.799 --> 13:46.679
respecting superiors,

313
13:46.919 --> 13:47.799
and caring for subordinates.

314
13:48.440 --> 13:50.240
Back at the brewery,

315
13:50.799 --> 13:52.360
I was quite well-liked.

316
13:53.279 --> 13:55.240
You can ask around and check for yourselves.

317
13:57.639 --> 13:58.799
And another thing,

318
14:00.240 --> 14:01.080
if you don't know

319
14:02.480 --> 14:03.440
someone well enough,

320
14:04.159 --> 14:05.240
you shouldn't go talking reckless.

321
14:05.879 --> 14:06.360
Right?

322
14:15.480 --> 14:16.120
Uncle,

323
14:16.720 --> 14:18.159
have you seen the news lately?

324
14:19.519 --> 14:21.879
There's been a serial murder case at Lapi Brewery.

325
14:27.120 --> 14:30.000
Catching criminals is the police's job.

326
14:31.440 --> 14:33.600
Just because someone died at the brewery,

327
14:33.679 --> 14:34.559
doesn't mean we should connect it

328
14:34.559 --> 14:36.360
to the factory's sale back then.

329
14:40.000 --> 14:40.840
Liu Xuemei?

330
14:41.000 --> 14:41.799
I don't really remember her.

331
14:43.120 --> 14:43.720
Back then,

332
14:43.720 --> 14:44.600
factories like that,

333
14:44.600 --> 14:45.480
there were plenty of them.

334
14:46.120 --> 14:46.799
As for the factory,

335
14:46.840 --> 14:47.360
selling it off,

336
14:47.759 --> 14:49.360
that wasn't the only one sold.

337
14:50.279 --> 14:50.840
Besides,

338
14:51.120 --> 14:52.120
selling the brewery

339
14:52.120 --> 14:54.120
was following national policy,

340
14:54.559 --> 14:56.159
pushing society forward, you know?

341
14:57.080 --> 14:57.440
Uncle...

342
14:57.440 --> 14:58.080
Leshui.

343
14:58.799 --> 14:59.960
I have some advice,

344
15:00.080 --> 15:01.399
though I'm not sure if I should say it.

345
15:02.320 --> 15:03.279
Go ahead, Uncle.

346
15:03.919 --> 15:05.240
I must remind you.

347
15:05.840 --> 15:07.559
You're a journalist.

348
15:08.159 --> 15:09.440
Watch how you talk.

349
15:09.720 --> 15:11.000
Know what to say

350
15:11.639 --> 15:13.200
and what not to say.

351
15:14.240 --> 15:15.799
Don't go making mistakes.

352
15:21.159 --> 15:22.039
A glass of plain water.

353
15:22.919 --> 15:23.840
First, a bit of coloring.

354
15:28.960 --> 15:29.960
Then add some alcohol.

355
15:30.679 --> 15:31.360
Just a drop.

356
15:31.480 --> 15:33.080
Too much of this knocks people out.

357
15:33.559 --> 15:35.440
Now, it's got no flavor, right?

358
15:38.519 --> 15:39.600
Beer flavoring.

359
15:42.519 --> 15:43.240
Just a splash.

360
15:44.840 --> 15:45.320
Good.

361
15:46.320 --> 15:47.480
Give it a stir first.

362
15:48.360 --> 15:49.879
The color is even,

363
15:51.919 --> 15:53.000
but there's no foam.

364
15:54.480 --> 15:55.480
Here's the crucial part.

365
15:56.240 --> 15:57.240
A pinch of baking soda.

366
15:58.159 --> 15:59.000
Go easy on this stuff.

367
15:59.000 --> 15:59.960
Too much makes it too fizzy.

368
16:02.840 --> 16:03.919
The most crucial step.

369
16:08.679 --> 16:09.159
Watch this.

370
16:16.120 --> 16:16.679
Take a whiff.

371
16:19.080 --> 16:19.799
Smells right, doesn't it?

372
16:21.919 --> 16:22.639
A pitcher of this

373
16:23.480 --> 16:24.480
normally sells for 9.90.

374
16:24.840 --> 16:25.600
How much do you make?

375
16:26.159 --> 16:26.840
A few cents, maybe.

376
16:27.600 --> 16:28.480
Sell mine,

377
16:28.679 --> 16:29.399
and per glass,

378
16:29.840 --> 16:31.080
you net eight bucks.

379
16:32.120 --> 16:32.879
Eight bucks.

380
16:34.120 --> 16:35.000
In this day and age,

381
16:35.120 --> 16:36.600
you can't be too honest in business.

382
16:36.600 --> 16:37.799
Be honest, and you won't make a dime.

383
16:38.159 --> 16:38.919
Look at mine—

384
16:42.159 --> 16:42.919
What "day and age"?

385
16:45.360 --> 16:47.000
No matter the era, you don't rip people off!

386
16:47.559 --> 16:48.600
Don't rip people off?

387
16:48.679 --> 16:49.240
What's that supposed to mean?

388
16:50.240 --> 16:50.799
Get out.

389
16:52.879 --> 16:53.240
What?

390
16:53.919 --> 16:54.279
Get lost.

391
16:55.039 --> 16:55.759
Piss off!

392
16:58.559 --> 16:59.799
You'll never amount to shit in this life!

393
17:03.759 --> 17:04.799
Move your car on your way out.

394
17:04.799 --> 17:05.440
It's in the way.

395
17:09.160 --> 17:09.720
Tieping.

396
17:10.359 --> 17:10.839
Ignore him.

397
17:11.400 --> 17:12.240
Get something to eat first.

398
17:14.039 --> 17:14.920
I already ate, Master.

399
17:15.799 --> 17:16.359
Don't worry about it.

400
17:16.359 --> 17:16.839
Go get some rest.

401
17:21.480 --> 17:22.039
Master.

402
17:23.359 --> 17:24.039
I got paid today.

403
17:26.920 --> 17:27.440
Go inside.

404
17:36.319 --> 17:36.759
Master.

405
17:37.319 --> 17:38.079
It's payday.

406
17:39.880 --> 17:40.680
Look...

407
17:41.759 --> 17:42.680
Every time,

408
17:43.160 --> 17:44.160
I've deposited it for you.

409
17:46.160 --> 17:46.960
This time,

410
17:48.039 --> 17:48.839
go deposit it yourself.

411
17:50.160 --> 17:51.319
After all, the money in the passbook

412
17:52.119 --> 17:52.920
is all yours.

413
17:53.839 --> 17:54.480
Wait, Master,

414
17:54.559 --> 17:56.000
I've never even been to a bank.

415
17:56.279 --> 17:57.319
You should still go.

416
17:57.559 --> 17:58.920
You can't rely on me forever.

417
18:00.319 --> 18:02.680
You have to learn to do things yourself.

418
18:03.480 --> 18:04.039
Look,

419
18:05.599 --> 18:06.559
you have a long life ahead of you.

420
18:09.000 --> 18:10.240
Go on. Do it yourself.

421
18:11.240 --> 18:12.039
You should really go, Master.

422
18:13.119 --> 18:14.000
Hurry up.

423
18:14.480 --> 18:14.920
Go.

424
18:31.759 --> 18:33.359
Layoffs are nothing to fear,

425
18:33.839 --> 18:36.200
the plant is always our home.

426
18:36.839 --> 18:38.880
Rejoin society with your own hands,

427
18:39.400 --> 18:41.839
learn a skill to feed the family.

428
18:41.839 --> 18:43.400
The plant is always our home.

429
18:43.880 --> 18:45.920
Rejoin society with your own hands,

430
18:46.160 --> 18:47.960
learn a skill to feed the family.

431
18:48.799 --> 18:51.839
Vocational Training for Laid-Off Workers

432
18:52.519 --> 18:53.359
Did you sign up?

433
18:53.599 --> 18:54.440
Why would I sign up?

434
18:54.759 --> 18:55.680
If I sign up,

435
18:55.680 --> 18:56.799
doesn't that mean I'm laid off?

436
18:56.799 --> 18:57.720
We don't even know the results yet.

437
18:57.920 --> 18:58.359
I'm not going.

438
18:58.440 --> 18:59.119
How about we...

439
18:59.440 --> 19:00.440
ask the director?

440
19:00.720 --> 19:01.119
Right.

441
19:01.279 --> 19:01.839
Good idea.

442
19:01.839 --> 19:02.759
Let's go ask the director,

443
19:02.960 --> 19:03.880
j-just to make sure.

444
19:04.240 --> 19:04.559
Tieping,

445
19:04.559 --> 19:05.839
whatever you do, don't sign up.

446
19:05.839 --> 19:06.680
Don't fall for it.

447
19:06.960 --> 19:07.559
Don't go.

448
19:12.880 --> 19:13.920
Director! Director! Director!

449
19:14.319 --> 19:15.839
What does this mean?

450
19:16.279 --> 19:16.680
Director,

451
19:16.680 --> 19:17.799
got any insider info for us?

452
19:18.079 --> 19:18.480
Director,

453
19:18.680 --> 19:20.839
is the layoff list out yet?

454
19:20.839 --> 19:21.960
Give us a hint, will you?

455
19:22.079 --> 19:22.400
Director,

456
19:22.400 --> 19:23.759
we'll be fine, right?

457
19:25.160 --> 19:25.720
Have you eaten?

458
19:26.400 --> 19:26.839
Not yet.

459
19:27.359 --> 19:28.359
Go grab some food, then.

460
19:29.000 --> 19:30.079
Can't work on an empty stomach.

461
19:31.559 --> 19:31.880
Go on.

462
19:33.000 --> 19:33.920
Go, go, go.

463
19:35.240 --> 19:36.119
Stop worrying over nothing.

464
19:40.519 --> 19:41.000
Master...

465
19:42.240 --> 19:43.079
Why so glum?

466
19:46.799 --> 19:47.279
Come on.

467
19:48.480 --> 19:49.519
I'll take you somewhere.

468
20:02.880 --> 20:03.519
Shut the door.

469
20:04.640 --> 20:05.519
It's freezing in here.

470
20:06.960 --> 20:08.000
Nobody's been here in ages.

471
20:12.519 --> 20:13.799
When I was your age,

472
20:15.640 --> 20:16.400
after clocking out every day,

473
20:16.559 --> 20:17.359
my master and the boys

474
20:17.359 --> 20:18.359
would bring me here to drink.

475
20:20.839 --> 20:21.400
I got drunk

476
20:21.400 --> 20:22.240
and told my master,

477
20:23.079 --> 20:23.559
"Someday,

478
20:23.920 --> 20:24.799
when I take an apprentice,

479
20:24.880 --> 20:25.960
I'll bring him here to drink too."

480
20:26.559 --> 20:28.880
This was our workshop's secret hideout.

481
20:30.640 --> 20:31.400
Light the stove.

482
20:31.960 --> 20:32.720
There's coal over there.

483
20:33.240 --> 20:33.720
Hurry.

484
20:42.599 --> 20:43.799
I remember you came here before.

485
20:45.160 --> 20:45.839
I did.

486
20:46.359 --> 20:47.480
My second year at the plant,

487
20:47.480 --> 20:48.279
they locked this place up.

488
20:50.119 --> 20:50.839
I remember.

489
20:52.119 --> 20:52.880
Back then,

490
20:53.359 --> 20:54.119
you were just a kid.

491
21:03.680 --> 21:04.599
You were tiny back then,

492
21:04.680 --> 21:05.039
weren't you?

493
21:05.799 --> 21:06.880
Sitting tucked away in the corner.

494
21:08.519 --> 21:09.319
Old Xu was over there,

495
21:09.680 --> 21:11.119
and Er Chengzi was over there.

496
21:11.119 --> 21:12.720
Er Chengzi pulled out that lighter,

497
21:13.000 --> 21:13.720
messing with you.

498
21:14.480 --> 21:14.960
He said

499
21:15.000 --> 21:15.759
it wouldn't strike,

500
21:15.759 --> 21:16.720
and told you to take a look.

501
21:17.240 --> 21:18.440
You leaned in,

502
21:18.559 --> 21:19.079
and snap!

503
21:20.519 --> 21:21.759
Nearly singed your eyebrows right off.

504
21:21.799 --> 21:22.240
Remember?

505
21:22.440 --> 21:22.680
Yeah.

506
21:23.119 --> 21:24.119
You've got a great memory, Master.

507
21:29.759 --> 21:30.559
Think this is enough?

508
21:31.119 --> 21:31.480
Yeah.

509
21:31.519 --> 21:32.400
This'll do for now.

510
21:32.519 --> 21:34.480
Let's get the fire going first.

511
21:53.079 --> 21:53.400
Here.

512
21:56.599 --> 21:57.359
Have a drink,

513
21:57.359 --> 21:58.160
it'll warm you up.

514
22:08.640 --> 22:10.200
Everyone says having a daughter is great,

515
22:10.920 --> 22:12.240
that she's Daddy's little girl.

516
22:13.039 --> 22:14.000
Still...

517
22:14.319 --> 22:15.359
when it comes to having a drink,

518
22:15.799 --> 22:16.880
nothing beats having a son.

519
22:21.839 --> 22:22.519
Flip that over.

520
22:27.480 --> 22:28.160
Tieping...

521
22:29.640 --> 22:30.680
A couple days ago,

522
22:31.279 --> 22:32.640
Xiao Liang from the workshop said

523
22:33.079 --> 22:34.039
he wants to strike out on his own.

524
22:34.839 --> 22:35.720
Said his second uncle

525
22:36.240 --> 22:37.240
chartered a big truck

526
22:37.279 --> 22:38.079
to help people move,

527
22:39.960 --> 22:41.119
make some money doing hard labor.

528
22:41.720 --> 22:42.759
Once that gets going,

529
22:43.240 --> 22:44.359
they'll be the founding crew.

530
22:46.680 --> 22:47.599
He told me the other day,

531
22:49.319 --> 22:50.279
they need someone

532
22:51.519 --> 22:52.400
strong,

533
22:52.920 --> 22:53.720
honest and dependable,

534
22:56.720 --> 22:57.880
someone who won't stir up any trouble.

535
22:58.759 --> 22:59.680
And looking at you,

536
23:00.240 --> 23:01.119
you fit the bill completely.

537
23:03.319 --> 23:04.599
At my age,

538
23:05.440 --> 23:06.960
they probably wouldn't want me anyway.

539
23:21.640 --> 23:21.960
Look.

540
23:25.839 --> 23:26.559
I'm just

541
23:28.440 --> 23:29.440
throwing out a hypothetical.

542
23:31.039 --> 23:31.559
Say,

543
23:33.039 --> 23:34.559
if the two of us got laid off,

544
23:35.319 --> 23:36.039
tell me,

545
23:37.440 --> 23:38.279
what could we even do?

546
23:41.640 --> 23:42.279
Master,

547
23:44.319 --> 23:45.079
what do you mean?

548
23:47.240 --> 23:48.359
Just keeping a backup plan, that's all.

549
23:51.759 --> 23:52.480
Master,

550
23:54.880 --> 23:56.079
you want to turn in the list and take the money?

551
24:00.519 --> 24:01.599
It's not just me.

552
24:17.240 --> 24:17.720
Master,

553
24:18.240 --> 24:19.119
I'm definitely not taking this money.

554
24:20.240 --> 24:21.119
Whoever wants this money

555
24:21.599 --> 24:22.160
can come get it from me.

556
24:33.720 --> 24:34.240
What are you doing?

557
24:35.079 --> 24:35.960
I can scrape up more later.

558
24:36.920 --> 24:37.799
Every month's pay,

559
24:38.240 --> 24:39.119
I'll give it all to you.

560
24:39.960 --> 24:40.759
It'll be enough sooner or later.

561
24:42.920 --> 24:44.039
Where did you get this money?

562
24:46.000 --> 24:47.599
All your monthly wages are with me.

563
24:48.400 --> 24:49.680
Where did you get this kind of cash?

564
24:55.640 --> 24:56.240
Tieping.

565
24:57.759 --> 25:00.319
Have you gotten mixed up with shady people?

566
25:07.640 --> 25:08.680
Those hoodlums...

567
25:09.359 --> 25:10.240
what did they get you into?

568
25:12.559 --> 25:13.440
I'm asking you!

569
25:14.039 --> 25:14.599
Answer me!

570
25:15.160 --> 25:16.240
No, Master.

571
25:39.599 --> 25:40.240
It's delicious.

572
25:54.400 --> 25:56.960
How long has it been since you had a proper meal?

573
26:06.960 --> 26:07.640
Are you stupid?

574
26:09.160 --> 26:10.359
You're still growing.

575
26:11.400 --> 26:12.079
How much can you really

576
26:12.240 --> 26:13.240
save by skimping on food?

577
26:29.240 --> 26:29.880
Tieping,

578
26:32.559 --> 26:33.559
about getting laid off,

579
26:34.680 --> 26:35.880
we've got to be prepared.

580
26:39.799 --> 26:40.759
But whatever we do,

581
26:42.480 --> 26:43.559
we can't let ourselves starve.

582
27:04.640 --> 27:05.319
Master,

583
27:06.759 --> 27:07.519
I don't want to leave.

584
27:09.640 --> 27:10.799
I just want to work at the factory.

585
27:12.240 --> 27:13.160
I just want to be a worker.

586
27:23.640 --> 27:24.519
I'm not leaving anyway.

587
27:25.519 --> 27:26.559
What are they gonna do?

588
27:30.839 --> 27:31.599
We're just not leaving.

589
27:53.920 --> 27:54.400
Right.

590
27:54.920 --> 27:55.680
We're not leaving.

591
27:56.160 --> 27:57.559
Let's see what he can do. Appliance Repair,

592
27:57.839 --> 27:58.680
and Auto Repair

593
27:58.799 --> 27:59.599
are already full.

594
28:00.279 --> 28:01.759
Pedicure and Reflexology Class

595
28:01.880 --> 28:03.440
has only three spots left.

596
28:03.519 --> 28:04.640
Register now.

597
28:04.720 --> 28:06.039
Attention, fellow workers.

598
28:08.519 --> 28:09.279
Look,

599
28:09.480 --> 28:11.079
I know you all have

600
28:11.519 --> 28:12.640
deep feelings for our factory.

601
28:13.920 --> 28:15.319
But Lapi Brewery right now...

602
28:15.839 --> 28:16.960
You all know our situation.

603
28:17.799 --> 28:19.680
Restructuring has truly become inevitable.

604
28:19.960 --> 28:20.720
We're overstaffed,

605
28:20.759 --> 28:21.440
heavily burdened,

606
28:21.440 --> 28:22.759
and productivity just won't rise.

607
28:22.960 --> 28:23.400
Therefore,

608
28:23.400 --> 28:25.640
some people must make sacrifices.

609
28:25.880 --> 28:26.319
Enough!

610
28:26.319 --> 28:27.519
Just read the list already.

611
28:27.519 --> 28:28.640
Stop stalling.

612
28:28.759 --> 28:29.279
Honestly.

613
28:29.359 --> 28:29.920
Fine, then.

614
28:30.079 --> 28:31.200
Since you're in a hurry, I'll read it.

615
28:32.039 --> 28:32.680
Publicity Department:

616
28:32.839 --> 28:33.640
Zhao Haipeng.

617
28:35.240 --> 28:35.759
Women's Federation:

618
28:35.960 --> 28:36.799
Tian Meihua.

619
28:38.319 --> 28:39.240
Finance Department:

620
28:39.319 --> 28:40.000
Qian Yichuan,

621
28:40.119 --> 28:40.640
Tu Chunyan.

622
28:41.039 --> 28:41.559
Logistics:

623
28:41.839 --> 28:42.519
Zhang Yuming.

624
28:42.720 --> 28:43.519
Forklift Team:

625
28:43.799 --> 28:44.480
Cao Jun,

626
28:44.880 --> 28:45.599
Wu Aigong.

627
28:45.960 --> 28:46.680
Inspection Department...

628
28:46.720 --> 28:47.519
I'm not leaving!

629
28:48.039 --> 28:48.960
None of us is leaving!

630
28:50.119 --> 28:51.400
This factory doesn't belong to you alone!

631
28:51.839 --> 28:52.680
Why should we leave?

632
28:52.839 --> 28:53.599
What are you doing?

633
28:55.759 --> 28:56.480
Security!

634
28:56.599 --> 28:56.920
Here!

635
28:56.920 --> 28:57.240
Tieping!

636
28:57.440 --> 28:58.240
What are you doing?

637
28:59.319 --> 28:59.880
What do you think you're doing?

638
29:00.359 --> 29:00.720
Tieping!

639
29:01.240 --> 29:02.359
The factory belongs to all of us!

640
29:02.480 --> 29:03.519
We won't leave! What can you do?

641
29:03.519 --> 29:04.000
Who let you in?

642
29:04.000 --> 29:04.880
Take him to the police station!

643
29:05.400 --> 29:05.839
Hurry up!

644
29:05.920 --> 29:06.920
Let go of me!

645
29:07.440 --> 29:08.759
Tieping, what are you doing?

646
29:09.119 --> 29:10.079
What do you want? I'm not leaving!

647
29:12.000 --> 29:12.440
Director!

648
29:12.559 --> 29:13.480
I don't know what's gotten into this kid.

649
29:14.039 --> 29:14.559
I'll handle him.

650
29:14.839 --> 29:15.759
I'll take him back and discipline him.

651
29:16.119 --> 29:16.799
Come on, let go.

652
29:17.240 --> 29:17.799
Cheng Youtian,

653
29:17.799 --> 29:18.160
Let go!

654
29:18.759 --> 29:20.599
with an apprentice like this,

655
29:20.839 --> 29:22.440
the factory definitely can't keep him!

656
29:23.039 --> 29:23.440
Director!

657
29:24.240 --> 29:24.759
Let go!

658
29:24.759 --> 29:26.680
Let go! Let go!

659
29:27.440 --> 29:27.839
Let go!

660
29:27.839 --> 29:28.559
Let go!

661
29:29.039 --> 29:29.839
Let go!

662
29:30.039 --> 29:31.119
Let go!

663
29:31.799 --> 29:32.599
Let go!

664
29:45.960 --> 29:46.920
The kid doesn't know any better.

665
29:47.559 --> 29:48.519
I apologize on his behalf.

666
29:49.119 --> 29:50.039
The country has laws,

667
29:50.039 --> 29:51.039
and the factory has rules.

668
29:51.440 --> 29:53.039
A bad master breeds a bad apprentice.

669
29:53.160 --> 29:54.519
You raised an apprentice like this,

670
29:54.559 --> 29:55.640
so what's the point of kneeling?

671
29:57.079 --> 29:57.400
Right.

672
29:58.839 --> 29:59.519
It's all my fault.

673
30:00.599 --> 30:01.240
It's on me.

674
30:02.680 --> 30:03.319
This kid...

675
30:04.000 --> 30:05.240
He grew up in an orphanage.

676
30:06.559 --> 30:07.400
He treats the factory as his home,

677
30:07.599 --> 30:08.599
and sees us as his parents.

678
30:09.759 --> 30:10.839
He has no other skills.

679
30:12.079 --> 30:14.880
He just wants to be an honest worker.

680
30:16.200 --> 30:17.160
Please keep him at the factory.

681
30:17.680 --> 30:18.519
Let him stay.

682
30:20.519 --> 30:21.440
Punish him however you want,

683
30:21.440 --> 30:22.400
just let him stay.

684
30:22.920 --> 30:24.079
Don't send him to the police.

685
30:24.599 --> 30:25.680
If he gets a criminal record,

686
30:26.519 --> 30:28.079
his whole life is ruined.

687
30:30.680 --> 30:31.799
I'm begging you.

688
30:31.880 --> 30:32.400
Master.

689
30:32.559 --> 30:33.200
Get up.

690
30:33.359 --> 30:34.440
Don't beg him.

691
30:34.640 --> 30:35.880
Don't beg him!

692
30:37.200 --> 30:37.640
Don't move!

693
30:38.279 --> 30:38.839
Tieping,

694
30:41.400 --> 30:42.119
apologize right now!

695
30:47.079 --> 30:48.079
Your parents died young,

696
30:49.400 --> 30:50.640
and I failed to raise you right.

697
30:52.680 --> 30:53.680
Disrespecting the leadership...

698
30:54.319 --> 30:55.279
You have no manners!

699
30:56.960 --> 30:58.240
Apologize to him right now!

700
31:04.000 --> 31:04.799
Apologize!

701
31:07.119 --> 31:07.799
Fine.

702
31:09.160 --> 31:09.880
If you won't apologize,

703
31:15.519 --> 31:16.200
I'll leave.

704
31:19.079 --> 31:20.640
I won't stay at this factory either!

705
31:24.640 --> 31:25.359
Master!

706
31:27.640 --> 31:28.440
I'm sorry.

707
31:28.960 --> 31:29.759
I'm sorry, Director.

708
31:30.319 --> 31:31.039
I was wrong.

709
31:32.960 --> 31:33.519
Louder!

710
31:33.640 --> 31:34.680
Let everyone hear you!

711
31:37.480 --> 31:38.680
I'm sorry, Director!

712
31:39.119 --> 31:40.319
I was wrong!

713
31:40.519 --> 31:42.400
This has nothing to do with my master!

714
31:42.640 --> 31:43.960
I apologize to you!

715
31:44.160 --> 31:45.559
I shouldn't have run my mouth!

716
31:56.799 --> 31:57.519
All right, that's enough.

717
31:57.759 --> 31:58.559
Let him go back to the factory.

718
31:58.720 --> 31:59.200
Back to the workshop.

719
31:59.200 --> 31:59.839
Get him back inside.

720
32:00.039 --> 32:00.640
Piss off!

721
32:07.559 --> 32:07.839
Let's go.

722
32:16.440 --> 32:17.200
Cheng Youtian.

723
32:18.720 --> 32:19.519
Hold on a second.

724
32:20.119 --> 32:21.279
I want to have a word with you.

725
32:23.039 --> 32:23.720
Jianguo.

726
32:24.440 --> 32:24.880
Old Ge.

727
32:25.799 --> 32:26.519
Take Tieping back.

728
32:27.359 --> 32:27.920
Back to the workshop.

729
32:28.279 --> 32:28.960
Take him back.

730
32:29.440 --> 32:29.920
Move.

731
32:32.720 --> 32:33.720
Cheng Youtian...

732
32:34.440 --> 32:37.440
You're truly Lapi Brewery's model worker.

733
32:40.440 --> 32:41.519
Quite impressive, aren't you?

734
32:44.799 --> 32:45.599
Thank you, Director.

735
32:47.759 --> 32:48.480
What're you doing?

736
32:49.880 --> 32:52.000
I think I heard you say just now

737
32:52.160 --> 32:53.799
that you won't work in this factory anymore.

738
32:53.799 --> 32:54.599
Right?

739
32:56.759 --> 32:57.839
Everyone here heard it, too.

740
32:57.839 --> 32:58.480
Didn't you?

741
32:58.759 --> 32:59.160
Right.

742
33:05.640 --> 33:06.599
I will now announce

743
33:07.160 --> 33:09.480
the bottling workshop layoff list.

744
33:09.880 --> 33:11.359
Cheng Youtian.

745
33:56.079 --> 33:57.000
Old classmate,

746
33:57.240 --> 33:59.119
there's nothing left for you in this case.

747
33:59.599 --> 34:00.599
Why haven't you gone back to Beijing yet?

748
34:02.359 --> 34:04.119
How come you had time to ask me out today?

749
34:05.680 --> 34:07.279
How do you guys usually solve cases?

750
34:09.239 --> 34:09.960
Interviewing me?

751
34:11.239 --> 34:12.119
Well, asking me about this,

752
34:12.559 --> 34:13.360
you've come to the right guy.

753
34:13.880 --> 34:14.920
When it comes to solving cases,

754
34:15.960 --> 34:16.559
there are no shortcuts.

755
34:17.880 --> 34:19.480
It's a real grind.

756
34:19.880 --> 34:21.079
Evidence,

757
34:21.079 --> 34:22.199
testimonies,

758
34:22.199 --> 34:23.280
clues,

759
34:23.280 --> 34:24.360
interview transcripts...

760
34:24.360 --> 34:25.559
You have to comb through them over and over.

761
34:26.000 --> 34:26.880
It gets on my nerves.

762
34:27.320 --> 34:28.119
And sometimes,

763
34:28.360 --> 34:30.199
you just have to bite the bullet and ask.

764
34:30.480 --> 34:32.119
You question the same person repeatedly,

765
34:32.119 --> 34:33.440
"Why did you do that?"

766
34:33.880 --> 34:35.840
Then from what they say,

767
34:35.920 --> 34:37.119
you catch their contradictions.

768
34:37.760 --> 34:38.880
Anyway, as long as you put in the effort

769
34:39.239 --> 34:40.320
and investigate thoroughly,

770
34:40.480 --> 34:42.599
you'll definitely figure it out.

771
34:43.159 --> 34:44.320
So what is our line of work about?

772
34:44.559 --> 34:45.599
Hunting for tiny clues,

773
34:46.039 --> 34:46.719
panning for gold in the sand.

774
34:48.360 --> 34:49.760
Good, then I did the right thing.

775
34:50.719 --> 34:51.320
What did you do?

776
34:55.320 --> 34:56.599
Do you know when Gao Xuelin

777
34:56.679 --> 34:58.280
joined your police force?

778
35:00.719 --> 35:01.480
Why are you asking about that?

779
35:03.360 --> 35:04.360
I've been to his hometown.

780
35:05.239 --> 35:05.960
Over the past few years,

781
35:06.119 --> 35:07.000
he kept coming to Lacheng.

782
35:07.719 --> 35:08.719
His transfer to Lacheng

783
35:09.039 --> 35:10.000
was definitely premeditated.

784
35:21.159 --> 35:22.440
Look at how busy you are,

785
35:23.320 --> 35:24.559
even investigating us cops.

786
35:26.719 --> 35:27.679
Look at him.

787
35:27.880 --> 35:28.920
Whenever he investigates,

788
35:28.920 --> 35:31.079
he's fixated on things from ten years ago.

789
35:32.840 --> 35:35.119
He asks everyone about Liu Xuemei's death.

790
35:37.159 --> 35:37.840
The way he questions people,

791
35:38.159 --> 35:38.760
the way he acts,

792
35:39.639 --> 35:40.679
it's all very strange.

793
35:41.880 --> 35:43.199
Don't you think something's off?

794
35:55.960 --> 35:57.559
Gao Xuelin's father was Gao Wusong,

795
35:58.199 --> 35:58.880
from Qingzhou.

796
35:59.239 --> 36:00.239
A cab driver.

797
36:01.239 --> 36:03.039
On December 31, 1999,

798
36:03.920 --> 36:04.960
he drove a passenger

799
36:05.199 --> 36:06.440
from Qingzhou to Lacheng.

800
36:06.599 --> 36:07.599
On the way back,

801
36:08.639 --> 36:09.559
due to drunk driving,

802
36:11.000 --> 36:11.920
he died in a crash.

803
36:16.880 --> 36:18.679
Do you know who his passenger was?

804
36:19.679 --> 36:20.599
Most likely,

805
36:20.960 --> 36:21.960
it was Liu Xuemei.

806
36:24.079 --> 36:25.119
On that exact same day,

807
36:25.920 --> 36:29.599
both died because of alcohol.

808
36:29.920 --> 36:30.960
Don't you find that strange?

809
36:34.880 --> 36:36.360
Gao Xuelin knows all about this.

810
36:37.599 --> 36:38.719
Did he ever report it to you?

811
36:47.800 --> 36:48.639
You're pretty professional.

812
36:48.639 --> 36:49.039
Seriously.

813
36:49.480 --> 36:50.320
I took it all in.

814
36:50.800 --> 36:51.639
You're really something.

815
36:51.880 --> 36:52.559
Well,

816
36:53.159 --> 36:54.039
thanks, old classmate.

817
36:54.320 --> 36:55.440
These clues you provided,

818
36:55.960 --> 36:56.840
I'll write them down in a bit.

819
37:01.440 --> 37:02.079
Say,

820
37:02.679 --> 37:04.119
maybe install a camera at home?

821
37:05.119 --> 37:06.800
I think that'd be a great idea.

822
37:07.039 --> 37:07.840
Good to be security-conscious.

823
37:08.639 --> 37:09.679
Living on your own out here,

824
37:09.880 --> 37:10.679
it's best to be careful.

825
37:28.280 --> 37:28.880
Let me

826
37:28.880 --> 37:29.639
propose a toast.

827
37:30.800 --> 37:33.800
Chen Yuan will make grade dean this year?

828
37:34.199 --> 37:35.679
Dad, I'm working on it.

829
37:36.000 --> 37:36.400
Good.

830
37:37.119 --> 37:39.000
Did Xiaohu get elected class monitor?

831
37:39.639 --> 37:41.079
Grandpa, I don't want to be class monitor.

832
37:42.159 --> 37:43.679
Then what do you want to be?

833
37:43.800 --> 37:44.280
A boss.

834
37:45.800 --> 37:46.840
When you grow up,

835
37:46.840 --> 37:47.880
you should be like your grandpa

836
37:48.559 --> 37:49.239
and become a director.

837
37:50.480 --> 37:51.119
Come on, come on.

838
37:51.119 --> 37:52.559
Cheers.

839
37:52.559 --> 37:53.079
Here, Xiaohu.

840
37:53.440 --> 37:53.880
Here.

841
38:00.480 --> 38:01.400
Eat up.

842
38:04.360 --> 38:05.199
Xiaohu.

843
38:06.159 --> 38:06.719
Dad.

844
38:07.400 --> 38:08.159
Lately,

845
38:08.280 --> 38:10.039
stay away from Lapi Brewery.

846
38:10.599 --> 38:11.599
Especially at night.

847
38:11.719 --> 38:12.360
It's not safe.

848
38:13.880 --> 38:14.960
Dad, you too.

849
38:15.199 --> 38:16.320
Don't wander around alone so much.

850
38:20.639 --> 38:21.159
By the way,

851
38:21.880 --> 38:22.400
Dad,

852
38:22.840 --> 38:24.039
do you remember Cao Jun?

853
38:25.360 --> 38:26.719
Cao Jun from Lapi Brewery.

854
38:27.000 --> 38:28.239
Isn't he dead?

855
38:29.239 --> 38:29.800
Yeah.

856
38:30.760 --> 38:31.559
A while ago,

857
38:31.760 --> 38:32.840
he wandered into our school,

858
38:32.960 --> 38:34.079
and the security guards kicked him out.

859
38:35.920 --> 38:37.079
What was he doing at your school?

860
38:37.239 --> 38:38.159
Beats me.

861
38:39.360 --> 38:39.920
Chen Yuan,

862
38:40.559 --> 38:41.679
back then,

863
38:41.679 --> 38:43.159
a good position was saved for you,

864
38:43.440 --> 38:44.239
yet you insisted

865
38:44.599 --> 38:46.880
on roughing it as a teacher.

866
38:47.320 --> 38:47.880
Of course,

867
38:48.079 --> 38:49.880
being a teacher is pretty good nowadays too.

868
38:51.320 --> 38:51.920
Dad,

869
38:52.400 --> 38:53.719
I actually enjoy teaching.

870
38:55.239 --> 38:56.039
I'd say

871
38:56.320 --> 38:59.599
you should've listened to Director Zheng back then.

872
39:01.159 --> 39:02.599
Here, let me toast to you.

873
39:04.119 --> 39:04.960
I'm retired now.

874
39:05.159 --> 39:06.719
Just an idle old man these days.

875
39:07.480 --> 39:08.559
Retired or not, you're still the Director.

876
39:19.320 --> 39:20.400
Does it still itch here?

877
39:21.119 --> 39:21.920
To the left. To the left.

878
39:22.679 --> 39:24.840
I went home and cleaned out the back room today.

879
39:24.960 --> 39:25.760
It's super spacious now.

880
39:27.079 --> 39:28.599
You should've spent that time resting.

881
39:29.119 --> 39:30.599
I've rested for plenty of years.

882
39:30.920 --> 39:32.320
I actually want to keep busy.

883
39:33.480 --> 39:35.400
I'll check Chunli's hair salon tomorrow.

884
39:35.800 --> 39:37.280
She happens to need a shampooer.

885
39:37.320 --> 39:38.800
It pays 3,000 a month.

886
39:39.480 --> 39:40.320
Shift work, too.

887
39:40.400 --> 39:42.239
In my free time, I can find other work.

888
39:43.000 --> 39:43.880
All right, all right.

889
39:43.920 --> 39:44.400
Stop scratching.

890
39:44.559 --> 39:45.000
That's enough.

891
39:45.079 --> 39:46.400
Go find the nurse.

892
39:46.480 --> 39:47.079
Let's get discharged.

893
39:47.280 --> 39:48.119
You haven't fully recovered yet.

894
39:48.119 --> 39:49.079
Where would you go?

895
39:49.280 --> 39:49.840
Good grief.

896
39:49.880 --> 39:51.159
Every day here costs money!

897
39:53.039 --> 39:53.880
I've made up my mind.

898
39:55.639 --> 39:56.440
I'm not staying here anymore.

899
39:56.800 --> 39:57.679
Leave this place.

900
39:59.039 --> 40:00.000
Leave this place?

901
40:00.880 --> 40:01.679
Where to?

902
40:02.679 --> 40:03.480
Facing the sea,

903
40:03.559 --> 40:04.599
where spring flowers bloom.

904
40:06.039 --> 40:06.960
Hainan?

905
40:07.079 --> 40:08.199
Forget Hainan.

906
40:08.239 --> 40:08.800
Sanya.

907
40:09.360 --> 40:09.960
Are you stupid?

908
40:09.960 --> 40:11.280
Isn't Sanya in Hainan?

909
40:11.639 --> 40:12.159
Is it?

910
40:13.440 --> 40:14.079
So what?

911
40:14.760 --> 40:15.800
It's so far away.

912
40:15.880 --> 40:16.880
You going alone?

913
40:17.480 --> 40:18.719
Why, you're not coming?

914
40:21.119 --> 40:22.639
You haven't officially invited me.

915
40:23.079 --> 40:24.800
Should I send you an invitation?

916
40:25.280 --> 40:26.440
Knowing your nature,

917
40:26.760 --> 40:27.239
all I have to do is whistle,

918
40:27.239 --> 40:28.559
and you'll come hopping right over.

919
40:30.119 --> 40:31.559
Wanna bet I'll douse you?

920
40:34.199 --> 40:35.000
Seriously, though,

921
40:35.599 --> 40:36.360
once you're discharged,

922
40:36.760 --> 40:38.239
get a haircut

923
40:38.559 --> 40:39.639
and shave your beard.

924
40:40.039 --> 40:41.599
You don't look like a decent guy.

925
40:41.840 --> 40:43.719
Being clean-cut doesn't make you a good guy.

926
40:43.719 --> 40:44.800
Keep talking nonsense.

927
40:46.880 --> 40:47.400
What?

928
40:47.840 --> 40:49.320
Got standards for my looks again?

929
40:49.559 --> 40:50.559
You bet.

930
40:51.679 --> 40:53.719
You need to clean up nice and sharp,

931
40:54.639 --> 40:55.559
just like back then,

932
40:55.840 --> 40:57.119
when you worked in accounting.

933
40:57.559 --> 40:58.559
What was I like back then?

934
40:59.280 --> 41:00.000
Super handsome.

935
41:00.440 --> 41:01.800
The handsomest guy in the factory.

936
41:01.920 --> 41:04.119
So you were just after my good looks back then.

937
41:04.360 --> 41:05.280
You're pretty shallow.

938
41:05.559 --> 41:07.000
And you're not?

939
41:07.760 --> 41:09.159
Wasn't I the prettiest in the factory too?

940
41:09.800 --> 41:10.559
Truth be told,

941
41:10.960 --> 41:12.920
you really were the hottest girl in our factory.

942
41:13.320 --> 41:14.480
Nonsense.

943
41:15.000 --> 41:16.800
Back then, you all said Liu Xuemei

944
41:16.800 --> 41:18.079
was the factory belle.

945
41:18.079 --> 41:19.079
I never said that.

946
41:19.119 --> 41:20.360
Liu Xuemei acted all smug every day,

947
41:20.360 --> 41:21.360
flirting with everyone she met.

948
41:21.440 --> 41:22.639
She didn't even know how to smile.

949
41:22.679 --> 41:23.840
Her face looked like a sweet potato.

950
41:23.840 --> 41:24.559
You were the one...

951
41:24.559 --> 41:25.320
who called her the factory belle.

952
41:25.320 --> 41:26.239
I called her the factory belle

953
41:26.239 --> 41:27.440
so everyone rushed after her,

954
41:27.559 --> 41:28.800
and left you for me.

955
41:29.719 --> 41:30.599
You idiot.

956
41:32.440 --> 41:32.960
Yan.

957
41:33.719 --> 41:34.559
Tieping is here.

958
41:35.039 --> 41:36.400
My... My master stewed an old hen.

959
41:36.559 --> 41:37.400
I brought it over on my way.

960
41:37.559 --> 41:38.320
Sneaking in so quietly.

961
41:38.400 --> 41:39.199
Thanks.

962
41:40.239 --> 41:41.360
It's not postpartum recovery,

963
41:41.719 --> 41:42.880
why chicken soup?

964
41:44.079 --> 41:45.239
Just thank him.

965
41:45.239 --> 41:46.800
He stewed chicken for you and you're complaining?

966
41:47.239 --> 41:47.760
This guy...

967
41:49.559 --> 41:50.199
Tieping,

968
41:51.280 --> 41:52.599
tell your master when you get back

969
41:52.960 --> 41:54.119
that the two of us are going to Sanya.

970
41:54.559 --> 41:55.480
Ask him if he wants to come.

971
41:55.719 --> 41:56.800
If he does, we can go together.

972
41:57.000 --> 41:58.480
It's super warm over there in winter.

973
41:58.679 --> 42:00.199
Everyone swims shirtless.

974
42:00.639 --> 42:01.480
When you're free,

975
42:01.920 --> 42:03.400
when you go to the bathhouse,

976
42:03.400 --> 42:04.280
practice holding your breath.

977
42:04.840 --> 42:05.960
Why would I practice holding my breath?

978
42:06.360 --> 42:07.320
In case I fall into the sea,

979
42:07.320 --> 42:08.239
so you can fish me out!

980
42:09.760 --> 42:10.719
No way am I doing that.

981
42:10.920 --> 42:12.239
I just want to see how you swim.

982
42:12.559 --> 42:13.920
What swimming style can a lame guy have?

983
42:13.960 --> 42:14.760
Just spinning around in circles,

984
42:14.760 --> 42:15.440
over and over.

985
42:15.440 --> 42:16.400
You silly fool.

986
42:16.440 --> 42:17.320
Your leg is all better?

987
42:17.320 --> 42:18.000
It's fine now.

988
42:18.639 --> 42:19.360
You silly idiot.

989
42:19.360 --> 42:20.440
Drink it while it's hot.

990
42:20.559 --> 42:21.719
Which ward is Qian Yichuan in?

991
42:21.920 --> 42:23.000
Room 208, Bed 16.

992
42:23.440 --> 42:23.880
Thanks.

993
42:25.960 --> 42:26.559
Tieping.

994
42:46.320 --> 42:47.039
Get off me.

995
42:48.639 --> 42:49.800
If he doesn't cherish you...

996
42:50.159 --> 42:51.280
I cherish you!

997
42:52.599 --> 42:53.280
I cherish you.
